QuestGuidance.Register("en",3,{
[65]="70008139\n1\tCollect old map-pages from Tarkrîp Orcs\tOld map-pages can be found on Orcs in the Tarkrîp Assault Camp. You should collect map-pages, for they look to be of some historic significance.\n2\tCollect historic map-pages (total: 7)\tOld map-pages can be found on Orcs in the Tarkrîp Assault Camp. You should collect map-pages, for they look to be of some historic significance.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have found a great number of scattered pages in the Tarkrîp Assault Camp. These will surely be better off back in the hands of the people of Trestlebridge, rather than in the claws of the scheming Orcs.\n",
[66]="70000CF9\n1\tTalk to Second Shirriff Bodo Bunce\tSecond Shirriff Bodo Bunce is by Town Hole in Michel Delving. You have been told to bring word of the many good deeds you have performed for the Shire-folk to Bodo Bunce.\n",
[67]="7000A997\n1\tTalk to Second Shirriff Bodo Bunce\tSecond Shirriff Bodo Bunce is by Town Hole in Michel Delving. You have been told to bring word of the many good deeds you have performed for the Shire-folk to Bodo Bunce.\n",
[68]="7004C12F\n1\tComplete 'A Spirited Harvest' four more times\tEvery day there is something to do during the Harvest Festival. Come and join everyone at the Party Tree, in Wistmead, and in housing neighbourhoods, and participate in many Harvest Festival activities for four days!\n2\tComplete 'A Spirited Harvest' (total: 3)\tEvery day there is something to do during the Harvest Festival. Come and join everyone at the Party Tree, in Wistmead, and in housing neighbourhoods, and participate in many Harvest Festival activities for four days!\n3\tRosa can be found near the Party Tree and in Wistmead. Rosa Hornblower would like to thank you for your continued participation in the Harvest Festival.\t\n",
[69]="7004C131\n1\tComplete 'A Spirited Harvest' four more times\tEvery day there is something to do during the Harvest Festival. Come and join everyone at the Party Tree, in Wistmead, and in housing neighbourhoods, and participate in many Harvest Festival activities for four days!\n2\tComplete 'A Spirited Harvest' (total: 3)\tEvery day there is something to do during the Harvest Festival. Come and join everyone at the Party Tree, in Wistmead, and in housing neighbourhoods, and participate in many Harvest Festival activities for four days!\n3\tRosa can be found near the Party Tree and in Wistmead. Rosa Hornblower would like to thank you for your continued participation in the Harvest Festival.\t\n",
[70]="7004C130\n1\tComplete 'A Spirited Harvest' four more times\tEvery day there is something to do during the Harvest Festival. Come and join everyone at the Party Tree, in Wistmead, and in housing neighbourhoods, and participate in many Harvest Festival activities for four days!\n2\tComplete 'A Spirited Harvest' (total: 3)\tEvery day there is something to do during the Harvest Festival. Come and join everyone at the Party Tree, in Wistmead, and in housing neighbourhoods, and participate in many Harvest Festival activities for four days!\n3\tRosa can be found near the Party Tree and in Wistmead. Rosa Hornblower would like to thank you for your continued participation in the Harvest Festival.\t\n",
[71]="7004C132\n1\tComplete 'A Spirited Harvest' four times\tEvery day there is something to do during the Harvest Festival. Come and join everyone at the Party Tree, in Wistmead, and in housing neighbourhoods, and participate in many Harvest Festival activities for four days!\n2\tComplete 'A Spirited Harvest' (total: 3)\tEvery day there is something to do during the Harvest Festival. Come and join everyone at the Party Tree, in Wistmead, and in housing neighbourhoods, and participate in many Harvest Festival activities for four days!\n3\tRosa can be found near the Party Tree and in Wistmead. Rosa Hornblower would like to thank you for your continued participation in the Harvest Festival.\t\n",
[72]="7002908F\n1\tDefeat the Dragon-clan chieftain\tThe brenin of the Dragon-clan settlement at the western edge of Pren Gwydh is somewhere within his encampment. You should defeat the head of this small band of cruel brigands, for it is by his orders that these enemies attack the lands and threaten the folk of Galtrev.\n2\tTalk to Tomos\tTomos is waiting for you on the outskirts of the Dragon-clan settlement in western Pren Gwydh. You should return to Tomos with word of your success. The Dragon-clan will trouble the folk of Galtrev no more.\n",
[73]="70037C6A\n1\tFind and defeat Asgája\tThe Uruk, Asgája, can be found somewhere nearby the stockpile south of the road to Middlemead from Entwade in Kingstead.\n2\tTalk to Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead. You have slain the hardy Uruk, Asgája, and should now report your success to Thane Edric.\n",
[74]="70062E55\n1\tAid Culhuc\030Aid Madog and Teilo Gwyniad\030Aid Marget\tEluna asked you to help folks around Lhan Garan. Help people around Lhan Garan.\n2\tTalk to Eluna\tYou have helped several people around town. It is time to return to Eluna in Lhan Garan.\n",
[75]="7002AE03\n1\tGather a stick from a nearby bush\030Gather coal near the servants' oven\tThe materials you need to replicate Virgil's snowman may be found around Frostbluff. In order to replicate Virgil's snowman, you will need to gather the right materials.\n2\tBuild the broken snowman at a snowpile\tThe snowman-field is outside of Winter-home. Now that you have gathered all of the supplies, use a snowpile to finish building the snowman.\n",
[76]="700280C2\n1\tFind a new wheel for the cart\tThe camp of the Dragon-clan raiders to the east may be a place to find new wheel. A new wheel for the cart must be found before it can continue on.\n2\tReplace the broken wheel\tThe broken wheel is at Andras' cart on the road in northern Starkmoor. Now that you have found a new wheel you should replace the old broken one.\n",
[77]="70000C31\n1\tTalk to Frideric the Elder\tFrideric the Elder awaits word from you at Ost Guruth, north of the Tornstones. After assisting the Earth-kin, Kekkonen sent you to speak with Frideric and let him know that they wish to become allies.\n",
[78]="700683C6\n1\tCollect spider-eggs ([see journal]/12)\tAn inventive answer to the dangers presented in harvesting spider-silk is to control the brood in the city. Khânai asks that you collect spider eggs from the nest in the desert so she can deliver them to the scholars and outfitters.\n2\tAfter collecting enough eggs from the spider's brood lair, you should return them to Khânai at the Hunter's camp in the Cape of Umbar.\t\n",
[79]="70042947\n1\tTalk to Bingo on the Brandywine Bridge\tThe Brandywine Bridge is located east of the town of Budgeford, in the Shire. Bingo has asked for a brief stop on the Brandywine Bridge to admire the view.\n2\tTalk to Prisca Boffin outside her home in Newbury\tPrisca Boffin's house is located in Newbury, just south of the Buckland Gate. Bingo wants to pay a visit to his cousin Prisca Boffin, who lives in Newbury, a small town in Buckland.\n3\tFind Angelica Boffin\030Find Berilac Boffin\030Find Camellia Boffin\030Find Dinodas Boffin\030Find Esmeralda Boffin\030Find Fosco Boffin\030Find Griffo Boffin\tPrisca Boffin told you some information about her children that may be useful in finding them throughout Crickhollow, Newbury, and Buckland: 'Angelica loves animals. She is always looking to feed and water the livestock, and even loves cleaning up after them! If there is an animal in jeopardy, she will be there as well, trying to help it! 'Berilac also likes to help out with chores, but only if they bring him near to a quiet, sunny place to sleep! He is likely sleeping in a haystack somewhere. 'Camellia left home with a bucket. She was going to get some water from the well. 'Dinodas has been sweet on young Celandine Brandybuck for some time now. She may know where he is. 'Esmeralda loves to go dancing in the Toad Marsh. 'Fosco is unusual among my children in that he loves the river and the ferry, and wants to learn boating! He is likely daydreaming not far from the Bucklebury Ferry. 'I went to the Buckland Faire with Griffo earlier today, but I had my fill before long and came home. Griffo may still be there. He was really tucking into his food when I left.'\n4\tTalk to Bingo outside Prisca's house, in Newbury\tPrisca Boffin's house is located in Newbury, just south of the Buckland Gate. You have found all of Prisca's children and should return to her house in victory.\n",
[80]="70047BD6\n1\tThe Dead Marshes can be found to the west and north of Ondoher's Folly. Faramir believes his brother might be found somewhere in the Dead Marshes to the west of Ondoher's Folly. You should search for any sign of Artamir, son of Ondoher.\t\n2\tTalk to Faramir, son of Ondoher\tFaramir can be found on the plains south of Ondoher's Folly. You did not discover any sign of Artamir or any spirit that might appear to be him. You should now return to Faramir.\n",
[81]="7005A4CF\n1\tReclaim the dwarf-axe\030Defeat Borbák the Shearer\tVáko has asked you to help him recover his brother's axe. Taking the axe may catch the attention of the Orc Borbák. The axe can be found somewhere in Dursh Hûl.\n2\tTalk to Váko\tBorbák has been defeated and the dwarf-axe reclaimed. You should return the axe to Váko in Amdân. He waits for you in the Zhélruka camp.\n",
[82]="700082B6\n1\tTalk to Oskari\030Collect Iivari's scroll\tOskari is somewhere among the camps of the Rauta-lehmä at Fashat Laug in the eastern North Downs. Iivari has given you a message to take to his brother Oskari. Iivari hopes that his words may be able to sway his brother and others of the Earth-kin to return to the Suuri-lehmä.\n2\tTalk to Iivari\030Collect Oskari's Rune\tIivari is in the Suuri-lehmä encampment, west of Fashat Laug. Oskari refused his brother's plea and gave you a rune to take back to Iivari.\n",
[83]="70041356\n1\tSearch out Herion's encampment.\tHerion's encampment is located somewhere south of Erchar's encampment, along the River Ernilos. You should search out Herion's camp.\n2\tSearch for Herion and his encampment\tHerion can be found in his encampment. You should speak with Herion.\n3\tSpeak with Aras\tAras can be found in Herion's encampment. You should speak with Aras about what he has seen.\n4\tSpeak with Herion\tHerion can be found at his encampment. You should speak with Herion about how you may be of assistance.\n",
[84]="70066586\n1\tTalk to Aras in Parth Rest\tHerion has asked you to help Aras with his work in Parth Rest. Aras can be found in Parth Rest.\n2\tDefeat wild crabs in Lang Boha (total: 12)\tAras in Parth Rest has asked you to defeat wild crabs to clear the way for homes to be rebuilt.\n3\tTalk to Aras\tYou should report to Aras that the crabs have been cleared. Aras can be found at Parth Rest.\n4\tTalk to Herion\tAras has asked you to report your success with Lang Boha to Herion. Herion can be found at Parth Rest.\n",
[85]="70044119\n1\tDefeat the siege-leader and his forces on the captured wall\tDefeat the forces of Mordor that have overtaken part of the wall of Minas Tirith before they can use Gondor's own siege equipment against it.\n",
[86]="700442D7\n1\tDefeat the siege-leader and his forces on the captured wall\tDefeat the forces of Mordor that have overtaken part of the wall of Minas Tirith before they can use Gondor's own siege equipment against it.\n",
[87]="7002C5F3\n1\tCollect samples of grodbog blood (0/6)\tGredbyg can be found throughout the Rushgore. Edbrit has noticed that the blood of the gredbyg in the Rushgore seems to boil and bubble, and he thinks this is the cause of their newfound aggressiveness. He wants you to collect samples of their blood and bring them to him.\n2\tCollect samples of grodbog blood (1/6)\tGredbyg can be found throughout the Rushgore. Edbrit has noticed that the blood of the gredbyg in the Rushgore seems to boil and bubble, and he thinks this is the cause of their newfound aggressiveness. He wants you to collect samples of their blood and bring them to him.\n3\tCollect samples of grodbog blood (2/6)\tGredbyg can be found throughout the Rushgore. Edbrit has noticed that the blood of the gredbyg in the Rushgore seems to boil and bubble, and he thinks this is the cause of their newfound aggressiveness. He wants you to collect samples of their blood and bring them to him.\n4\tCollect samples of grodbog blood (3/6)\tGredbyg can be found throughout the Rushgore. Edbrit has noticed that the blood of the gredbyg in the Rushgore seems to boil and bubble, and he thinks this is the cause of their newfound aggressiveness. He wants you to collect samples of their blood and bring them to him.\n5\tCollect samples of grodbog blood (4/6)\tGredbyg can be found throughout the Rushgore. Edbrit has noticed that the blood of the gredbyg in the Rushgore seems to boil and bubble, and he thinks this is the cause of their newfound aggressiveness. He wants you to collect samples of their blood and bring them to him.\n6\tCollect samples of grodbog blood (5/6)\tGredbyg can be found throughout the Rushgore. Edbrit has noticed that the blood of the gredbyg in the Rushgore seems to boil and bubble, and he thinks this is the cause of their newfound aggressiveness. He wants you to collect samples of their blood and bring them to him.\n7\tBring samples of gredbyg blood to Edbrit\tEdbrit is waiting for you to bring him samples of blood from the gredbyg in the Rushgore. Edbrit has noticed that the blood of the gredbyg in the Rushgore seems to boil and bubble, and he thinks this is the cause of their newfound aggressiveness. He wants you to collect samples of their blood and bring them to him.\n",
[88]="70062DD5\n1\tFind the water bucket along the river west of Idhobel\tLornel's bucket was left somewhere beside the river west of Idhobel.\n2\tTalk to Lornel at Idhobel\tLornel is by the camp-fire at Idhobel.\n",
[89]="7000B988\n1\tClear brambles from road (total: 6)\030Clear treacherous stones from road (total: 4)\030Defeat great glen-bucks (total: 4)\tThe road runs north of Echad Candelleth and south through Tâl Bruinen. The road that runs through Tâl Bruinen often becomes choked with brambles and treacherous stones and is threatened by glen-bucks. Bainthir has offered you a reward if you can help him with his duty of keeping the road clear.\n2\tTalk to Bainthir\tBainthir is at Echad Candelleth, the Elf-camp in Tâl Bruinen. You have helped clear the road which runs through Tâl Bruinen of many hazards and should return now to Bainthir for your reward.\n",
[90]="70000060\n1\tTalk to Palma Brownlock\tPalma Brownlock is waiting for you at The Forsaken Inn in the Lone-lands, just off the Great East Road. You received a mysterious message that one \"Palma Brownlock\" is waiting to speak with you.\n2\tTalk to Palma Brownlock and travel to Naerost\tPalma Brownlock is at The Forsaken Inn in the Lone-lands. Palma Brownlock is waiting to travel with you to the hideout of the half-orcs that stole the sword she mentioned.\n3\tBring Medhrod to Palma Brownlock\tPalma Brownlock is at The Forsaken Inn in the Lone-lands. Palma Brownlock is waiting to speak with you about your successful infiltration of Naerost.\n",
[91]="7002844C\n1\tCollect hatchets (total: 10)\tAxes can be found in the uruk-encampment in eastern Nan Curunír. Quickbeam asked you to gather the uruks' axes.\n2\tThrow the axes into a bonfire in the uruk-encampment\tThere are bonfires in the uruk-encampment of eastern Nan Curunír. Quickbeam asked you to throw the axes you collected into one of the bonfires in the uruk-encampment.\n3\tTalk to Quickbeam in Nan Curunír\tQuickbeam is at his home upon the north-eastern slopes of Nan Curunír. You should tell Quickbeam that you have destroyed many of the uruks' axes.\n",
[92]="70047F54\n1\tComplete 'A Taste of Spring' (total: 4)\tEvery day there is something to do during the Spring Festival. Come and join everyone and participate in many Spring Festival activities for four more days!\n2\tTalk to Sergeant Tom\030Talk to Rhudamer Hirtul\tYou have participated in Spring Festival activities for twelve days. You should talk to either Sergeant Tom at the Bree-land Festival Grounds or Rhudamer Hirtul near the Stable-master in Clegur.\n",
[93]="70047F56\n1\tComplete 'A Taste of Spring' (total: 4)\tEvery day there is something to do during the Spring Festival. Come and join everyone and participate in many Spring Festival activities for four more days!\n2\tTalk to Sergeant Tom\030Talk to Rhudamer Hirtul\tYou have participated in Spring Festival activities for eight days. You should talk to either Sergeant Tom at the Bree-land Festival Grounds or Rhudamer Hirtul near the Stable-master in Clegur.\n",
[94]="70047F55\n1\tComplete 'A Taste of Spring' (total: 4)\tEvery day there is something to do during the Spring Festival. Come and join everyone and participate in many Spring Festival activities for four days!\n2\tTalk to Sergeant Tom\030Talk to Rhudamer Hirtul\tYou have participated in Spring Festival activities for four days. You should talk to either Sergeant Tom at the Bree-land Festival Grounds or Rhudamer Hirtul near the Stable-master in Clegur.\n",
[95]="70072C06\n1\tSpeak with Ahâto in Sen Chatâk\030Speak with Kôrzan in Sen Chatâk\030Speak with Jûshal in Sen Chatâk\tElder Jangâli has requested you speak with Ahâto, Kôrzan, and Jûshal about their daily troubles and assist them where you are able. Each can be found within Sen Chatâk.\n2\tReturn to Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk\tReturn to Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk and let her know you have spoken with each of the villagers.\n",
[96]="70041377\n1\tDefeat insects in the Dead Marshes (total: 15)\tThe number of large insects in the Dead Marshes is almost unbearable. Their numbers should be thinned. You should defeat a number of insects in the Dead Marshes.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of insects in the Dead Marshes.\n",
})
